<header>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
    <h1>🔄 {{ t('Narrative Rotation', '主题轮动') }} <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400">· {{ t(d.market_en, d.market_zh) }}</span></h1>
    <span class="asof"><span class="pfx">{{ t('as of', '截至') }} </span>{{ d.as_of }} · {{ t('vs', '对标') }} {{ t(d.bench_label, d.bench_label_zh) }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="tagline">{{ t(
    'Identify the prevailing narrative, judge its durability, ride it while it trends, and step aside before the music stops. The one edge validated on multi-decade sector backtests is NOT picking next year\'s winner — it is avoiding the crash that ends a crowded trend. So this is a discipline, not a prediction.',
    '识别当前主导叙事，评估其持续性，趋势在时持有，音乐停前退场。在跨越数十年的行业回测中得到验证的优势并非"押中明年赢家"，而是"避开终结拥挤趋势的那次崩盘"。因此这是纪律，而非预测。') }}</p>
</header>

<!-- ============ HEADLINE: current best place to allocate ============ -->
{% set H = d.headline %}
{% if H %}
<section class="hero" style="margin-top:14px">
  <div class="big">
    <div class="lead">{{ t('Prevailing narrative — current best place to allocate', '主导叙事 — 当前最佳配置去向') }}</div>
    <div class="name">{{ t(H.name, H.name_zh) }}</div>
    <div class="wt">{{ t('Suggested weight', '建议权重') }} <b>{{ (H.weight*100)|round|int }}%</b>
      · {{ t('cash', '现金') }} {{ (H.cash*100)|round|int }}%</div>
    <div class="chips">
      {% if H.durability_bar is not none %}<span class="chip {{ 'ok' if H.durability_bar>=0.66 else '' }}">{{ t('durability', '持续性') }} {{ (H.durability_bar*100)|round|int }}/100</span>{% endif %}
      {% if H.hurst_tag %}<span class="chip">{{ t('trend regime', '趋势状态') }}: {{ t(H.hurst_tag, {'trend':'趋势','mean-revert':'均值回归','mixed':'混合'}.get(H.hurst_tag, H.hurst_tag)) }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if H.crowded %}<span class="chip hot">{{ t('crowded → sized down', '拥挤 → 已降仓') }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if H.one_narrative %}<span class="chip" style="background:rgba(124,92,255,.12);border-color:rgba(124,92,255,.4)">{{ t('one narrative dominates', '单一叙事主导') }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Read', '解读') }}: <span class="l-en">{{ d.narration.en|safe }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ d.narration.zh|safe }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="gauge">
    <div class="gz"><div class="k">{{ t('Themes in uptrend', '上行趋势主题') }}</div><div class="v">{{ d.rotation.breadth_of_rotation.eligible }}/{{ d.rotation.breadth_of_rotation.total }}</div></div>
    <div class="gz"><div class="k">{{ t('Suggested cash', '建议现金') }}</div><div class="v">{{ (d.allocation.cash*100)|round|int }}%</div></div>
    <div class="gz"><div class="k">{{ t('One-narrative gauge', '单一叙事度') }}</div><div class="v">{{ (d.rotation.absorption*100)|round|int if d.rotation.absorption is not none else '—' }}%</div></div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if d.allocation.crash_overlay.active %}
<div class="banner crash">⚠ <b>{{ t('Momentum-crash state', '动量崩盘状态') }}</b> — {{ t(
  'the broad market is below its 2-year trend with elevated volatility (the regime where momentum reverses violently). Exposure is halved to cash. This is the only state where the engine steps off the gas.',
  '大盘跌破两年趋势且波动抬升（动量剧烈反转的状态）。敞口已减半至现金。这是引擎唯一主动减速的状态。') }}</div>
{% endif %}

{% if d.rotation.one_narrative %}
<div class="banner dom">🧲 <b>{{ t('One narrative vs everything', '单一叙事 vs 其他') }}</b> ({{ t('absorption', '共动') }} {{ (d.rotation.absorption*100)|round|int }}%) — {{ t(
  'leadership is concentrated in a single theme. The engine CAPS the leader (it does not fade it — fading the dominant trend on a crowding flag is the documented way to lose) and routes the remainder toward broadening themes.',
  '领跑高度集中于单一主题。引擎对领跑者封顶（而非反向 — 在拥挤信号下反向押注主导趋势是有据可查的亏损方式），其余配置流向扩散中的主题。') }}</div>
{% endif %}

<!-- ============ 01 SUGGESTED ALLOCATION ============ -->
<h2><span class="idx">01</span>{{ t('Suggested allocation', '建议配置') }}</h2>
<p class="sub">{{ d.allocation.rule }}</p>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="alloc">
    {% for w in d.allocation.weights %}
    <div class="arow">
      <span class="nm">#{{ w.rank }} {{ t(w.name, w.name_zh) }}
        {% if w.crowded %}<span class="chip hot" style="margin-left:4px">{{ t('crowded', '拥挤') }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="bar"><span class="fill" style="width:{{ ((w.weight/0.35*100) if w.weight>0 else 0)|round(1) }}%"></span></span>
      <span class="wv">{{ (w.weight*100)|round|int }}%</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    <div class="arow cash">
      <span class="nm">{{ t('Cash / T-bills', '现金 / 短债') }}</span>
      <span class="bar"><span class="fill" style="width:{{ (d.allocation.cash*100/0.35)|round(1) }}%"></span></span>
      <span class="wv">{{ (d.allocation.cash*100)|round|int }}%</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t(
    'Equal-weight by design — the momentum rank has ~0 forward information coefficient on the clean universe, so we ride the trending leaders without betting conviction on the exact order. Crowded themes are trimmed toward cash (a sizing caution, never a sell or a short).',
    '刻意采用等权 — 在干净样本上动量排名的前瞻信息系数约为0，因此我们持有处于趋势中的领跑者，但不对其精确排序押注信心。拥挤主题被向现金削减（仅为仓位审慎，绝非卖出或做空）。') }}</p>
</div>

<!-- ============ 02 NARRATIVE LIFECYCLE BOARD ============ -->
<h2><span class="idx">02</span>{{ t('Narrative lifecycle board', '叙事生命周期看板') }}
  <span class="chip">{{ t('rank = focus lens, not a forecast', '排名=关注透镜，非预测') }}</span></h2>
<p class="sub">{{ t(
  'Every theme ranked by ensemble momentum (residual + raw + acceleration), with its trend-eligibility gate, durability, and crowding texture. Durability CONFIRMS a trend (it lags ~half a window) — it does not forecast the handoff.',
  '所有主题按集成动量（残差+原始+加速度）排名，并附趋势准入门、持续性与拥挤纹理。持续性是对趋势的"确认"（滞后约半个窗口）— 并不预测交接。') }}
  <span class="muted">{{ t('Click a theme name to open its constituents on the Thematic Baskets page.', '点击主题名称可在主题篮子页面查看其成分。') }}</span></p>
{% set BASKETS_PAGE = {'us':'baskets.html','china':'baskets_china.html','hk':'baskets_hk.html','canada':'baskets_canada.html'}.get(d.region, 'baskets.html') %}
<div class="panel"><div class="ts">
<table>
  <thead><tr>
    <th>{{ t('Theme', '主题') }}</th>
    <th class="num">{{ t('Score', '评分') }}</th>
    <th>{{ t('Trend', '趋势') }}</th>
    <th class="num" title="durability bar">{{ t('Durability', '持续性') }}</th>
    <th class="num" title="own-history regime">{{ t('Hurst', '赫斯特') }}</th>
    <th class="num" title="% members above 50d MA">{{ t('Breadth', '广度') }}</th>
    <th class="num">{{ t('Crowding', '拥挤度') }}</th>
  </tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for r in d.ranks %}
  {% set du = r.durability %}{% set cr = r.crowding %}
  <tr class="{{ '' if r.eligible else 'inelig' }}">
    <td><b><a class="tlink" href="{{ BASKETS_PAGE }}#b-{{ r.id }}">{{ t(r.name, r.name_zh) }}<span class="jump" title="Open in Thematic Baskets">↗</span></a></b>
      {% if r.rank==1 %}<span class="stage lead">{{ t('LEADER', '领跑') }}</span>{% endif %}
      <div class="legrow">{{ r.category }} · {{ r.n_live }} {{ t('names', '只') }}</div></td>
    <td class="num"><b>{{ '%.2f'|format(r.score) if r.score is not none else '—' }}</b></td>
    <td>{% if r.eligible %}<span class="stage" style="color:var(--up)">▲ {{ t('in trend', '趋势内') }}</span>{% else %}<span class="stage" style="color:var(--muted)">▽ {{ t('off trend', '趋势外') }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td class="num">{% if du.bar is not none %}<span class="dbar"><i style="width:{{ (du.bar*100)|round|int }}%"></i></span> {{ (du.bar*100)|round|int }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ du.hurst if du.hurst is not none else '—' }}{% if du.hurst_tag %}<span class="muted sm"> {{ {'trend':'↗','mean-revert':'↺','mixed':'~'}.get(du.hurst_tag,'') }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ (du.breadth*100)|round|int if du.breadth is not none else '—' }}{% if du.breadth is not none %}%{% endif %}</td>
    <td class="num">{% if cr.crowding_z is not none %}<span class="{{ 'neg' if cr.crowded else 'muted' }}">{{ zfmt(cr.crowding_z) }}</span>{% if cr.crowded %} <span class="chip hot" style="margin:0">{{ t('hot', '热') }}</span>{% endif %}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div></div>

<!-- ============ 03 ROTATION RADAR ============ -->
{% set R = d.rotation %}
<h2><span class="idx">03</span>{{ t('Rotation radar', '轮动雷达') }} <span class="chip">{{ t('display-only', '仅展示') }}</span></h2>
<p class="sub">{{ t(
  'Leadership now, and how broad it is. A handoff is only flagged when CONFIRMED (a challenger overtakes with margin) — the engine never predicts the next narrative (rotation-timing has no validated edge, even with foresight).',
  '当前领跑及其广度。仅在"确认"后才提示交接（挑战者带优势超越）— 引擎从不预测下一叙事（即便有先知，轮动择时也无可验证优势）。') }}</p>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="kpis">
    <div><div class="k">{{ t('Leader', '领跑') }}</div><div class="v">{{ t(R.leader.name, R.leader.name_zh) if R.leader.name else '—' }}</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">{{ t('Challenger', '挑战者') }}</div><div class="v" style="font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)">{{ t(R.challenger.name, R.challenger.name_zh) if R.challenger.name else '—' }}</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">{{ t('Lead margin', '领先优势') }}</div><div class="v">{{ R.margin if R.margin is not none else '—' }}</div></div>
    <div><div class="k">{{ t('Breadth of rotation', '轮动广度') }}</div><div class="v">{{ R.breadth_of_rotation.eligible }}/{{ R.breadth_of_rotation.total }}
      <span class="chip" style="vertical-align:middle">{{ t(R.breadth_of_rotation.view, {'broad':'广泛','narrowing':'收窄','narrow':'狭窄'}.get(R.breadth_of_rotation.view, R.breadth_of_rotation.view)) }}</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="tagline">{{ t(
    'Broadening leadership = a healthy, durable trend regime. Narrowing leadership (a few names carrying it) = late-cycle fragility — the engine raises cash as fewer themes trend.',
    '领跑面扩散=健康、可持续的趋势环境。领跑面收窄（少数名字支撑）=周期后段的脆弱性 — 趋势主题越少，引擎现金越高。') }}</p>
</div>

<!-- ============ 04 THE WORKHORSE BACKTEST (honest) ============ -->
{% set B = d.backtest %}
{% if B.sectors %}
<h2><span class="idx">04</span>{{ t('What is actually validated — sector backtest', '真正验证过的 — 行业回测') }}</h2>
<p class="sub">{{ t(
  'The theme baskets are hindsight-curated and only ~3y, so they cannot validate anything. The ALGORITHM, however, runs on the long, clean sector-ETF history below. The verdict is what survives.',
  '主题篮子为事后整理且仅约3年，无法验证任何东西。但该"算法"可在下方长期、干净的行业 ETF 历史上运行。结论即为存活下来的部分。') }}
  <span class="muted">({{ B.sectors.span[0] }} → {{ B.sectors.span[1] }})</span></p>

{% if B.gate_helps == False %}
<div class="banner crash">⚠ <b>{{ t('Experimental in this market', '本市场属实验性') }}</b> — {{ t(
  'on ' + d.market_en + '’s own history the trend gate did NOT reduce drawdown (this tape mean-reverts, so timing whipsaws). Treat the suggested allocation here as DISPLAY/experimental and lean on the cross-market US/Canada result with caution.',
  '在' + d.market_zh + '自身历史上，趋势门并未降低回撤（该市场均值回归，择时易被反复打脸）。请将此处的建议配置视为展示/实验性，并谨慎参考美国/加拿大的跨市场结果。') }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if B.borrowed_from %}
<div class="banner dom">ℹ {{ t(
  d.market_en + ' sector-ETF coverage is too thin to re-validate locally — the table below is the cross-market proxy (' + B.borrowed_from + '). Trend-following’s drawdown-control edge is market-universal, but read it as a prior, not a local proof.',
  d.market_zh + '的行业 ETF 覆盖太薄，无法在本地重新验证 — 下表为跨市场代理（' + B.borrowed_from + '）。趋势跟随的回撤控制优势具有跨市场普适性，但应视为先验而非本地证明。') }}</div>
{% endif %}
<div class="panel">
  <div class="ts"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>{{ t('Strategy', '策略') }}</th><th class="num">CAGR</th><th class="num">Sharpe</th><th class="num">{{ t('Max DD', '最大回撤') }}</th><th class="num" title="avg return in the worst-decile down months">{{ t('Crash months', '崩盘月') }}</th><th class="num" title="deflated Sharpe — survives multiple testing if >=0.90">DSR</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for key, lab, labzh in [('dual','Dual-momentum book (this engine)','双动量组合（本引擎）'),('rel','Relative-momentum only','仅相对动量'),('buyhold','Equal-weight buy & hold','等权买入持有')] %}
    {% set s = B.sectors[key] %}{% if s %}
    <tr{% if key=='dual' %} style="background:rgba(90,167,255,.07)"{% endif %}>
      <td>{% if key=='dual' %}<b>{{ t(lab, labzh) }}</b>{% else %}{{ t(lab, labzh) }}{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ (s.cagr*100)|round(1) }}%</td>
      <td class="num">{{ s.sharpe }}</td>
      <td class="num neg">{{ (s.max_dd*100)|round(1) }}%</td>
      <td class="num neg">{{ (s.worst_decile_ret*100)|round(1) if s.worst_decile_ret is not none else '—' }}%</td>
      <td class="num">{% if s.dsr is not none %}<b class="{{ 'pos' if s.dsr>=0.9 else 'muted' }}">{{ s.dsr }}</b>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  {% if B.sectors.tsmom %}
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:10px"><b>{{ t('The validated edge is risk control, not alpha.', '验证过的优势是风险控制，而非阿尔法。') }}</b>
    {{ t('Above vs below the trend gate, forward return is statistically identical, but Sharpe is', '在趋势门上方 vs 下方，前瞻收益在统计上一致，但夏普为') }}
    <b>{{ B.sectors.tsmom.above_trend.sharpe }}</b> {{ t('vs', '对') }} <b>{{ B.sectors.tsmom.below_trend.sharpe }}</b>
    {{ t('and the bad-month tail is', '且坏月尾部为') }} <b>{{ (B.sectors.tsmom.above_trend.p05*100)|round(1) }}%</b> {{ t('vs', '对') }} <b>{{ (B.sectors.tsmom.below_trend.p05*100)|round(1) }}%</b>.
    {{ t('Cross-sectional rank-IC is ≈0 (momentum ranks where to look, the trend gate decides whether to be in at all).', '横截面 rank-IC≈0（动量决定"看哪里"，趋势门决定"是否在场"）。') }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% if B.verdict %}
  <div class="verdict">
    {% for k, lab, labzh in [('relative_momentum','Momentum rank','动量排名'),('absolute_trend_gate','Trend gate','趋势门'),('basket_extension','Basket crowding','篮子拥挤'),('rotation_timing','Rotation timing','轮动择时')] %}
    {% if B.verdict[k] %}<div class="vcard"><b>{{ t(lab, labzh) }}</b><br><span class="muted">{{ B.verdict[k] }}</span></div>{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<!-- ============ 05 AI DESK HANDOFF ============ -->
{% set A = d.ai_handoff %}
<h2><span class="idx">05</span>{{ t('AI desk — what the inference layer may and may not conclude', 'AI 桌 — 推断层可与不可下的结论') }}</h2>
<p class="sub">{{ t(
  'This page is the quant DETECTION layer. It hands a structured, falsifiability-bounded contract to the AI judge so the narrative read stays honest — the AI focuses analysis, it does not invent edge.',
  '本页是量化"探测"层。它向 AI 裁判交付一份带可证伪边界的结构化契约，使叙事解读保持诚实 — AI 用于聚焦分析，而非凭空制造优势。') }}</p>
<div class="panel">
  <p style="font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px"><b>{{ t('Verdict', '结论') }}:</b> {{ A.overall_verdict }}</p>
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:0">{{ A.reader_contract }}</p>
  <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px"><b>{{ t('The AI is FORBIDDEN to conclude', 'AI 被禁止得出的结论') }}:</b>
  <ul class="dnc">{% for x in A.do_not_conclude %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:8px"><b>{{ t('Directive', '指令') }}:</b> {{ A.ai_directive }}</p>
</div>

<!-- live desk: falsifiable per-theme leans (fetched client-side; degrades to the contract above) -->
<div id="thematic-desk" data-region="{{ d.region }}" style="margin-top:12px">
  <div class="story" style="margin:6px 0 2px">{{ t('Desk read — falsifiable hypotheses, graded over time', '桌面解读 — 可证伪假设，长期被打分') }}
    <span class="chip">{{ t('display-only', '仅展示') }}</span><span id="td-track" class="chip" style="display:none"></span></div>
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:0">{{ t(
    "The desk's fallible, falsifiable leans — each with a check-by date and graded against reality over time, so you learn whether to trust it. Never a buy list, never a size; the validated edge on this page is drawdown control.",
    '桌面给出的可证伪方向性判断 — 每条都有检验截止日，并随时间对照现实打分，让你判断是否值得信任。绝非买入清单、绝非仓位；本页验证过的优势是回撤控制。') }}</p>
  <p id="td-regime" class="story" style="display:none;font-size:13.5px"></p>
  <div id="td-cards" class="cards-td"></div>
  <p id="td-watch" class="tagline" style="display:none;margin-top:8px"></p>
  <details id="td-panel-wrap" style="display:none;margin-top:6px">
    <summary class="muted" style="font-size:12px;cursor:pointer">{{ t('What the analysts argued (adversarial panel)', '分析师论点（对抗式专家组）') }}</summary>
    <div id="td-panel"></div>
  </details>
  <p id="td-empty" class="tagline" style="display:none">{{ t(
    'The live desk note has not been generated yet (the AI layer runs in the daily build). The contract above still governs what it may conclude.',
    '实时桌面简报尚未生成（AI 层在每日构建中运行）。上方契约仍约束其可下的结论。') }}</p>
</div>

<footer>
  {{ t(
    'Read-only analytics for informational purposes only — NOT investment advice and NOT a buy/sell list. The thematic baskets are equal-weight, point-in-time dated-membership trackers over a free ~3-5y price cache, benchmarked to ' + d.bench_label + ' and curated with knowledge of the period — so they are HINDSIGHT-descriptive, not an out-of-sample backtest. The allocation ALGORITHM is validated on multi-decade sector-ETF history (see panel 04), where its only repeatable edge is drawdown/shake-out control via the absolute-trend gate; cross-sectional momentum has ~0 forward rank-IC and basket-level crowding has no forward drawdown edge (it only sizes down). Durability, crowding and rotation are coincident, display-only context — none of them feeds any score. See LIMITATIONS.md and scripts/thematic_rotation_phase0.py.',
    '仅供参考的只读分析 — 非投资建议，也非买卖清单。主题篮子为等权、按时点日期管理成分、基于免费约3-5年价格缓存，以 ' + d.bench_label + ' 为基准，且在已知该期表现下整理 — 故为事后描述性序列，并非样本外回测。该配置"算法"在跨越数十年的行业 ETF 历史上验证（见面板04），其唯一可重复的优势是通过绝对趋势门控制回撤/被甩出；横截面动量前瞻rank-IC约为0，篮子层面拥挤无前瞻回撤优势（仅用于降仓）。持续性、拥挤与轮动均为同步的、仅展示的背景 — 都不进入任何评分。参见 LIMITATIONS.md 与 scripts/thematic_rotation_phase0.py。') }}
  {{ t('Generated', '生成于') }} {{ generated_utc }}.
</footer>
<script src="ai_desk_thematic.js"></script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
